summary:
  A play takes the station's address from the live row after a .pls or .m3u
  has been unwrapped.

history:
  A list write while the wrapper was unwrapped (a logo the popup found, a
  heal) cleared and refilled the model, and the row read after it answered
  empty: the station played with no name, and a click on its row started it
  again instead of stopping it. The play now reads the row before the unwrap.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                  root._currentOrigUrl = home;

replace:
                  root._currentOrigUrl = (station.hostname || "").toString();

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_play_reads_its_row_before_the_address_is_unwrapped.
  Line-neutral.
